/-!
# MonetaryExistenceBuyer

Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of the manuscript *Existence of a stationary monetary equilibrium
with buyer-takes-all bargaining* (Johannes Nägele, 2026).

**Provenance.** Unlike the paper, this Lean code was almost entirely generated by large language
models (Anthropic's Claude, run as a coding agent) under the author's direction; see the section
"Provenance and disclaimer" of `README.md`. The Lean kernel checks the proofs; what a reader should
compare with the paper are the definitions and the statements of the main theorems.
-/
